# MASM Data Processing Utility

A complete, functional MASM (Microsoft Assembly x86) utility for processing structured data.

## Features
- Read text-based structured data (CSV/TSV)
- Parse fields and validate format
- Transform data (uppercase, trim, numeric validation)
- Export cleaned data

## Usage
- Compile using MASM (ml.exe) and Linker (link.exe)
- Run the executable with input file path as argument (if implemented, or hardcoded for demo)

## Files
- main.asm: Entry point and control logic
- processor.asm: Core processing routines
- parser.asm: Data parsing logic
- validator.asm: Validation checks
- transformer.asm: Data transformation routines
- reporter.asm: Output generation

## Dependencies
- MASM (ml.exe)
- Microsoft Linker (link.exe)
- Windows API (Kernel32.dll, User32.dll)

## Build Instructions
```bash
ml /c /coff main.asm
ml /c /coff processor.asm
ml /c /coff parser.asm
ml /c /coff validator.asm
ml /c /coff transformer.asm
ml /c /coff reporter.asm
link /SUBSYSTEM:CONSOLE main.obj processor.obj parser.obj validator.obj transformer.obj reporter.obj
```
